      "content": "it’s just so quiet out here tonight. staring at the dashboard and thinking about how i've driven through three states and haven't even spoken to a real person in two days. feels like if i just stopped driving and didn't show up anywhere... the world wouldn't even notice. just kind of a hollow feeling.",
